",\"basename\":\"/docs\",\"path\":\"/velo\"},\"seoConfig\":{\"homePageTitle\":\"\",\"homePageDescription\":\"\",\"pageTitleSuffix\":\"\",\"hideFromSearchEngines\":true},\"embeddedScripts\":[]},\"exposure\":\"PUBLIC\",\"displayGroup\":\"APIS_AND_SDKS\",\"displayOrder\":1,\"homepageResourceId\":\"1196de4c-221c-451e-bcb8-19ca20c2b18a\"}","stringifiedDocRevision":"{\"id\":\"383ed62a-dab5-4562-bf05-ec1220363948\",\"createdDate\":\"2025-01-12T09:29:11.959Z\",\"updatedDate\":\"2025-01-12T09:29:11.959Z\",\"resourceId\":\"4226f67a-73d7-47fd-acd0-e8e474f9f390\",\"sdk\":{\"schema\":{\"name\":\"velo_$w\",\"fqn\":\"\",\"slug\":\"velo-w\",\"typesMap\":{\"Element.Element\":{\"name\":\"Element\",\"fqn\":\"Element.Element\",\"slug\":\"element\",\"actions\":[{\"name\":\"delete\",\"fqn\":\"Element.Element.delete\",\"slug\":\"delete\",\"isDeprecated\":false,\"isInternal\":false,\"actionErrors\":[],\"isDeveloperPreview\":false,\"maturity\":\"GA\",\"adminMethod\":false,\"returnType\":{\"kind\":\"PROMISE\",\"argumentType\":{\"kind\":\"PRIMITIVE\",\"name\":\"void\"},\"description\":\"Fulfilled - When the element's `deleted` property has been set to `true`.\"},\"description\":\"Deletes an element from the [DOM](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Document_Object_Model/Introduction). \\r\\nThis is a temporary deletion. Use [`restore`](#restore) to restore the deleted element.  \\r\\n\\r\\nSEO crawlers cannot find content in an element whose `deleted` status is `true`. \\r\\nContent in an element that is in `hidden` status can be found by crawlers.\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003e**Note:** An element whose `deleted` status is `true` can be edited.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe `delete()` function returns a Promise that is resolved when the\\r\\n element's `deleted` property has been set to `true`.\",\"sdkErrors\":[]},{\"name\":\"onMouseIn\",\"fqn\":\"Element.Element.onMouseIn\",\"slug\":\"on-mouse-in\",\"isDeprecated\":false,\"isInternal\":false,\"actionErrors\":[],\"isDeveloperPreview\":false,\"maturity\":\"GA\",\"requiredProperties\":[\"handler\"],\"adminMethod\":false,\"returnType\":{\"kind\":\"REFERENCE\",\"name\":\"Element\",\"referenceFqn\":\"Element.Element\",\"description\":\"The element to which the event handler was added.\"},\"actionParams\":[{\"name\":\"handler\",\"slug\":\"handler\",\"isDeprecated\":false,\"isInternal\":false,\"maturity\":\"GA\",\"type\":{\"kind\":\"REFERENCE\",\"name\":\"MouseEventHandler\",\"referenceFqn\":\"MouseEventHandler\",\"isFunction\":true},\"description\":\"The name of the function or\\r\\n the function expression to run when the pointer is moved onto the\\r\\n element.\"}],\"description\":\"Adds an event handler that runs when the pointer is moved\\r\\n onto the element.\",\"sdkErrors\":[]},{\"name\":\"onMouseOut\",\"fqn\":\"Element.Element.onMouseOut\",\"slug\":\"on-mouse-out\",\"isDeprecated\":false,\"isInternal\":false,\"actionErrors\":[],\"isDeveloperPreview\":false,\"maturity\":\"GA\",\"requiredProperties\":[\"handler\"],\"adminMethod\":false,\"returnType\":{\"kind\":\"REFERENCE\",\"name\":\"Element\",\"referenceFqn\":\"Element.Element\",\"description\":\"The element to which the event handler was added.\"},\"actionParams\":[{\"name\":\"handler\",\"slug\":\"handler\",\"isDeprecated\":false,\"isInternal\":false,\"maturity\":\"GA\",\"type\":{\"kind\":\"REFERENCE\",\"name\":\"MouseEventHandler\",\"referenceFqn\":\"MouseEventHandler\",\"isFunction\":true},\"description\":\"The name of the function or\\r\\n the function expression to run when the pointer is moved off of\\r\\n the element.\"}],\"description\":\"Adds an event handler that runs when the pointer is moved\\r\\n off of the element.\",\"sdkErrors\":[]},{\"name\":\"onViewportEnter\",\"fqn\":\"ViewportMixin.onViewportEnter\",\"slug\":\"on-viewport-enter\",\"isDeprecated\":false,\"isInternal\":false,\"actionErrors\":[],\"isDeveloperPreview\":false,\"maturity\":\"GA\",\"requiredProperties\":[\"handler\"],\"adminMethod\":false,\"returnType\":{\"kind\":\"REFERENCE\",\"name\":\"Element\",\"referenceFqn\":\"Element.Element\",\"description\":\"The element on which the event is now registered.\"},\"examples\":[{\"title\":\"Get the ID of the element that has entered the viewport\",\"content\":\"$w(\\\"#myElement\\\").onViewportEnter( (event) =\u003e {\\n  let targetId = event.target.id; // \\\"myElement\\\"\\n});\"}],\"actionParams\":[{\"name\":\"handler\",\"slug\":\"handler\",\"isDeprecated\":false,\"isInternal\":false,\"maturity\":\"GA\",\"type\":{\"kind\":\"REFERENCE\",\"name\":\"EventHandler\",\"referenceFqn\":\"EventHandler\",\"isFunction\":true},\"description\":\"The name of the function or\\r\\n the function expression to run when the element enters the viewport.\"}],\"description\":\"Adds an event handler that runs when an element is displayed\\r\\n in the viewable part of the current window.\\r\\n\\r\\nAn element enters the viewport when the page is scrolled to show any\\r\\n part of the element. An element also enters the viewport if it was\\r\\n `hidden` or `collapsed`\\r\\n and is then shown or expanded in the viewable part of the current window. `onViewportEnter()` \\r\\n is not fired for `hidden` or `collapsed` \\r\\n elements even if they are scrolled into view.\",\"sdkErrors\":[]},{\"name\":\"onViewportLeave\",\"fqn\":\"ViewportMixin.onViewportLeave\",\"slug\":\"on-viewport-leave\",\"isDeprecated\":false,\"isInternal\":false,\"actionErrors\":[],\"isDeveloperPreview\":false,\"maturity\":\"GA\",\"requiredProperties\":[\"handler\"],\"adminMethod\":false,\"returnType\":{\"kind\":\"REFERENCE\",\"name\":\"Element\",\"referenceFqn\":\"Element.Element\",\"description\":\"The element on which the event is now registered.\"},\"examples\":[{\"title\":\"Get the ID of the element that has left the viewport\",\"content\":\"$w(\\\"#myElement\\\").onViewportLeave( (event) =\u003e {\\n  let targetId = event.target.id; // \\\"myElement\\\"\\n});\"}],\"actionParams\":[{\"name\":\"handler\",\"slug\":\"handler\",\"isDeprecated\":false,\"isInternal\":false,\"maturity\":\"GA\",\"type\":{\"kind\":\"REFERENCE\",\"name\":\"EventHandler\",\"referenceFqn\":\"EventHandler\",\"isFunction\":true},\"description\":\"The name of the function or\\r\\n the function expression to run when the element leaves the viewport.\"}],\"description\":\"Adds an event handler that runs when an element is no longer\\r\\n displayed in the viewable part of the current window.\\r\\n\\r\\nAn element leaves the viewport when the page is scrolled so that the\\r\\n element is completely out of view. An element also leaves the viewport\\r\\n if it was shown or expanded and is then `hidden`\\r\\n or `collapsed` from the viewable part\\r\\n of the current window.  `onViewportLeave()` \\r\\n is not fired for `hidden` or `collapsed` \\r\\n elements even if they are scrolled out of view.\",\"sdkErrors\":[]},{\"name\":\"restore\",\"fqn\":\"Element.Element.restore\",\"slug\":\"restore\",\"isDeprecated\":false,\"isInternal\":false,\"actionErrors\":[],\"isDeveloperPreview\":false,\"maturity\":\"GA\",\"adminMethod\":false,\"returnType\":{\"kind\":\"PROMISE\",\"argumentType\":{\"kind\":\"PRIMITIVE\",\"name\":\"void\"},\"description\":\"Fulfilled - When the element's `deleted` property has been set to `false`.\"},\"description\":\"Restores a deleted element to the [DOM](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Document_Object_Model/Introduction).\\r\\n\\r\\nThe `restore()` function returns a Promise that is resolved when the\\r\\n element's `deleted` property has been set to `false`.\\r\\n See the [`delete`](#delete) function.\",\"sdkErrors\":[]},{\"name\":\"scrollTo\",\"fqn\":\"Node.scrollTo\",\"slug\":\"scroll-to\",\"isDeprecated\":false,\"isInternal\":false,\"actionErrors\":[],\"isDeveloperPreview\":false,\"maturity\":\"GA\",\"adminMethod\":false,\"returnType\":{\"kind\":\"PROMISE\",\"argumentType\":{\"kind\":\"PRIMITIVE\",\"name\":\"void\"},\"description\":\"Fulfilled - When the scroll is complete.\"},\"examples\":[{\"title\":\"Scroll the page to an element\",\"content\":\"$w(\\\"#myElement\\\").scrollTo();\"},{\"title\":\"Scroll the page to an element and log a message when done\",\"content\":\"$w(\\\"#myElement\\\").scrollTo()\\n  .then( ( ) =\u003e {\\n    console.log(\\\"Done with scroll\\\");\\n} );\"}],\"description\":\"Scrolls the page to the top of the element using an animation.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe `scrollTo()` function returns a Promise that is resolved when the\\r\\n animated scroll is complete and the element is in view.\\r\\n\\r\\n To scroll to a specific location on the page, see the `wix-window-frontend`\\r\\n [`scrollTo()`](wix-window-frontend.html#scrollTo) function. \\r\\n\\r\\n \u003e **Tip**: Use the `wix-window-frontend` [`scrollTo()`](wix-window-frontend.html#scrollTo) function to \\r\\n scroll directly to an element, and also disable the animation. \\r\\n To get the coordinates for scrolling, display the Wix Editor Toolbar. In the Editor, \\r\\n move the cursor to the top-left pixel where you want the page to scroll to. The **X** \\r\\n and **Y** axis **Position** values show the coordinates.\\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n\\r\\n \u003e **Note:** \\r\\n \u003e To use `scrollTo()` with a header element, the [Header Scroll Setting](https://support.wix.com/en/article/wix-editor-changing-the-header-scroll-settings) must be set to **Scrolls with site**. To scroll to the header with other settings, use the `wix-window-frontend` [`scrollTo()`](wix-window-frontend.html#scrollTo) function.\",\"sdkErrors\":[]}],\"properties\":[{\"name\":\"customClassList\",\"slug\":\"custom-class-list\",\"isReadOnly\":true,\"isDeprecated\":false,\"isInternal\":false,\"maturity\":\"GA\",\"type\":{\"kind\":\"REFERENCE\",\"name\":\"CustomClassList\",\"referenceFqn\":\"CustomClassList.CustomClassList\"},\"description\":\"A property that represents an element's custom CSS classes.\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003e This property is not yet available to all users.\\r\\n\\r\\nYou can use this property to manipulate the custom CSS classes of an element. For example, \\r\\nyou can add a custom class to an element or replace an existing class with a new custom class.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nCustom classes are those that you create on your site, not the predefined global classes\\r\\nthat are provided for each element.  \\r\\n\\r\\n\u003e **Note:** For more information, see [Styling Elements with CSS](https://www.wix.com/velo/reference/$w/styling-elements-with-css) \\r\\n\u003e and the [MDN CSS reference docs](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn/CSS).\"},{\"name\":\"deleted\",\"slug\":\"deleted\",\"isReadOnly\":true,\"isDeprecated\":false,\"isInternal\":false,\"maturity\":\"GA\",\"type\":{\"kind\":\"PRIMITIVE\",\"name\":\"boolean\"},\"description\":\"Indicates if an element was temporarily deleted from the [DOM](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Document_Object_Model/Introduction).\\r\\nUse the [`restore`](#restore) function to restore the deleted element.\\r\\n\\r\\nIf `deleted` is `true`, the element is not in the current DOM.\\r\\n\\r\\n If `deleted` is `false` the element is in the current DOM.\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003e**Notes:**\\r\\n\u003e - An element whose `deleted` status is `true` can be edited.\\r\\n\u003e - In Wix Studio, an element whose `deleted` status is `false` will not be displayed if the element has been set to **Hide**.\"},{\"name\":\"global\",\"slug\":\"global\",\"isReadOnly\":true,\"isDeprecated\":false,\"isInternal\":false,\"maturity\":\"GA\",\"examples\":[{\"title\":\"Get whether an element is displayed on all pages\",\"content\":\"let isGlobal = $w(\\\"#myElement\\\").global; // false\"}],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"PRIMITIVE\",\"name\":\"boolean\"},\"description\":\"Indicates if an element appears on all pages or only on the current page.\\r\\n\\r\\nIf `global` is `true`, the element appears on all pages.\\r\\n\\r\\n If `global` is `false`, the element only appears on the current page.\"},{\"name\":\"id\",\"slug\":\"id\",\"isReadOnly\":true,\"isDeprecated\":false,\"isInternal\":false,\"maturity\":\"GA\",\"examples\":[{\"title\":\"Get the ID\",\"content\":\"let myId = $w(\\\"#myElement\\\").id; // \\\"myElement\\\"\"}],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"PRIMITIVE\",\"name\":\"string\"},\"description\":\"Gets the element's ID.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe ID is the element's unique identifier. It is used when selecting\\r\\n elements using the [`$w()`]($w.html#$w) function.\\r\\n\\r\\n An element's `id` is set in the Editor using the [Properties panel](https://support.wix.com/en/article/how-do-i-use-the-properties-panel).\"},{\"name\":\"parent\",\"slug\":\"parent\",\"isReadOnly\":true,\"isDeprecated\":false,\"isInternal\":false,\"maturity\":\"GA\",\"examples\":[{\"title\":\"Get the parent element and the parent's ID\",\"content\":\"let parentElement = $w(\\\"#myElement\\\").parent;\\n\\nlet parentId = parentElement.id; // \\\"page1\\\"\"}],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"REFERENCE\",\"name\":\"Node\",\"referenceFqn\":\"Node.Node\"},\"description\":\"Gets the element's parent element.\\r\\n\\r\\nSome elements can contain other elements. This occurs when you drag\\r\\n an element onto a container element. The container is the `parent` of\\r\\n all the elements it contains.\\r\\n\\r\\n [`Page`]($w.Page.html), [`Header`]($w.Header.html), and\\r\\n [`Footer`]($w.Footer.html) are top-level elements and have no parent.\"},{\"name\":\"rendered\",\"slug\":\"rendered\",\"isReadOnly\":true,\"isDeprecated\":false,\"isInternal\":false,\"maturity\":\"GA\",\"type\":{\"kind\":\"PRIMITIVE\",\"name\":\"boolean\"},\"description\":\"Indicates if an element is currently in the [DOM structure](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Document_Object_Model/Introduction).\\r\\n\\r\\nIf `rendered` is `true`, the element is in the current DOM structure and\\r\\n can be used.\\r\\n\\r\\n If `rendered` is `false` the element is not in the current DOM structure.\\r\\n\\r\\n An element might not be in the DOM if it is in a [slide]($w.Slide.html) or a [state]($w.State.html)\\r\\n which is not currently showing.\"},{\"name\":\"type\",\"slug\":\"type\",\"isReadOnly\":true,\"isDeprecated\":false,\"isInternal\":false,\"maturity\":\"GA\",\"examples\":[{\"title\":\"Get the element's type\",\"content\":\"let myType = $w(\\\"#myElement\\\").type; // \\\"$w.Type\\\"\"}],\"type\":{\"kind\":\"PRIMITIVE\",\"name\":\"string\"},\"description\":\"Gets the element's type.\\r\\n\\r\\nPossible values include:\\r\\n\\r\\n - `$w.TextInput`\\r\\n - `$w.TextBox`\\r\\n - `$w.RichTextBox`\\r\\n - `$w.RadioButtonGroup`\\r\\n - `$w.CheckboxGroup`\\r\\n - `$w.Dropdown`\\r\\n - `$w.SelectionTags`\\r\\n - `$w.Slider`\\r\\n - `$w.DatePicker`\\r\\n - `$w.UploadButton`\\r\\n - `$w.RatingsInput`\\r\\n - `$w.AddressInput`\\r\\n - `$w.Switch`\\r\\n - `$w.SignatureInput`\\r\\n - `$w.Captcha`\"}]},\"CustomClassList.CustomClassList\":{\"name\":\"CustomClassList\",\"fqn\":\"CustomClassList.CustomClassList\",\"slug\":\"custom-class-list\",\"actions\":[{\"name\":\"add\",\"fqn\":\"CustomClassList.CustomClassList.add\",\"slug\":\"add\",\"isDeprecated\":false,\"isInternal\":false,\"actionErrors\":[],\"isDeveloperPreview\":false,\"maturity\":\"GA\",\"requiredProperties\":[\"className\"],\"adminMethod\":false,\"returnType\":{\"kind\":\"PRIMITIVE\",\"name\":\"void\"},\"actionParams\":[{\"name\":\"className\",\"slug\":\"class-name\",\"isDeprecated\":false,\"isInternal\":false,\"maturity\":\"GA\",\"type\":{\"kind\":\"ARRAY\",\"elementType\":{\"kind\":\"PRIMITIVE\",\"name\":\"string\"}},\"description\":\"The names of the custom classes to add to an element.\"}],\"description\":\"Adds custom CSS classes to an element's class list.\\r\\n\\r\\nAdds one or more custom CSS classes to the class list of an element.\",\"sdkErrors\":[]},{\"name\":\"contains\",\"fqn\":\"CustomClassList.CustomClassList.contains\",\"slug\":\"contains\",\"isDeprecated\":false,\"isInternal\":false,\"actionErrors\":[],\"isDeveloperPreview\":false,\"maturity\":\"GA\",\"requiredProperties\":[\"className\"],\"adminMethod\":false,\"returnType\":{\"kind\":\"PRIMITIVE\",\"name\":\"boolean\"},\"actionParams\":[{\"name\":\"className\",\"slug\":\"class-name\",\"isDeprecated\":false,\"isInternal\":false,\"maturity\":\"GA\",\"type\":{\"kind\":\"PRIMITIVE\",\"name\":\"string\"},\"description\":\"Custom class to check.\"}],\"description\":\"Indicates whether the element's class list contains a specified custom CSS class. \\r\\nReturns `true` if the element contains the class.\",\"sdkErrors\":[]},{\"name\":\"remove\",\"fqn\":\"CustomClassList.CustomClassList.remove\",\"slug\":\"remove\",\"isDeprecated\":false,\"isInternal\":false,\"actionErrors\":[],\"isDeveloperPreview\":false,\"maturity\":\"GA\",\"requiredProperties\":[\"className\"],\"adminMethod\":false,\"returnType\":{\"kind\":\"PRIMITIVE\",\"name\":\"void\"},\"actionParams\":[{\"name\":\"className\",\"slug\":\"class-name\",\"isDeprecated\":false,\"isInternal\":false,\"maturity\":\"GA\",\"type\":{\"kind\":\"ARRAY\",\"elementType\":{\"kind\":\"PRIMITIVE\",\"name\":\"string\"}},\"description\":\"The custom class to remove from the element's list of classes.\"}],\"description\":\"Removes custom CSS classes from an element's class list.\\r\\n\\r\\nRemoves one or more custom CSS classes from an element's class list.\",\"sdkErrors\":[]},{\"name\":\"replace\",\"fqn\":\"CustomClassList.CustomClassList.replace\",\"slug\":\"replace\",\"isDeprecated\":false,\"isInternal\":false,\"actionErrors\":[],\"isDeveloperPreview\":false,\"maturity\":\"GA\",\"requiredProperties\":[\"currentClassName\",\"newClassName\"],\"adminMethod\":false,\"returnType\":{\"kind\":\"PRIMITIVE\",\"name\":\"boolean\"},\"actionParams\":[{\"name\":\"currentClassName\",\"slug\":\"current-class-name\",\"isDeprecated\":false,\"isInternal\":false,\"maturity\":\"GA\",\"type\":{\"kind\":\"PRIMITIVE\",\"name\":\"string\"},\"description\":\"The custom class to replace.\"},{\"name\":\"newClassName\",\"slug\":\"new-class-name\",\"isDeprecated\":false,\"isInternal\":false,\"maturity\":\"GA\",\"type\":{\"kind\":\"PRIMITIVE\",\"name\":\"string\"},\"description\":\"The new class to add.\"}],\"description\":\"Replaces a custom CSS class of an element with a different custom CSS class.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe `replace()` function replaces a custom CSS class of an element with a different custom class. \\r\\nIf the `currentClassName` is not one of the element's classes, the element's class list is not affected. \\r\\nReturns `true` if the replacement is successful.\",\"sdkErrors\":[]},{\"name\":\"toggle\",\"fqn\":\"CustomClassList.CustomClassList.toggle\",\"slug\":\"toggle\",\"isDeprecated\":false,\"isInternal\":false,\"actionErrors\":[],\"isDeveloperPreview\":false,\"maturity\":\"GA\",\"requiredProperties\":[\"className\"],\"adminMethod\":false,\"returnType\":{\"kind\":\"PRIMITIVE\",\"name\":\"boolean\"},\"actionParams\":[{\"name\":\"className\",\"slug\":\"class-name\",\"isDeprecated\":false,\"isInternal\":false,\"maturity\":\"GA\",\"type\":{\"kind\":\"PRIMITIVE\",\"name\":\"string\"},\"description\":\"The custom class to toggle.\"}],\"description\":\"Toggles an element's custom CSS class.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe `toggle()` function either adds or removes an element's custom CSS class.\\r\\n- Returns `false` when an existing custom class gets removed from the element's class list.\\r\\n- Returns `true` when the custom class gets added to the element's class list.\",\"sdkErrors\":[]},{\"name\":\"values\",\"fqn\":\"CustomClassList.CustomClassList.values\",\"slug\":\"values\",\"isDeprecated\":false,\"isInternal\":false,\"actionErrors\":[],\"maturity\":\"GA\",\"adminMethod\":false,\"returnType\":{\"kind\":\"ARRAY\",\"elementType\":{\"kind\":\"PRIMITIVE\",\"name\":\"string\"}},\"description\":\"Gets an array of strings listing an element's custom CSS classes.\",\"sdkErrors\":[]}],\"properties\":[]},\"Node.Node\":{\"name\":\"Node\",\"fqn\":\"Node.Node\",\"slug\":\"node\",\"actions\":[{\"name\":\"scrollTo\",\"fqn\":\"Node.Node.scrollTo\",\"slug\":\"scroll-to\",\"isDeprecated\":false,\"isInternal\":false,\"acti