ription\":\"Adds an event handler that runs when the element is double-clicked.\\r\\n\\r\\nAn element receives a `dblClick` event when a user double-clicks on the element\\r\\n and releases.\\r\\n\\r\\n When a user double-clicks an element, two `click` events are fired\\r\\n before a `doubleClick` event is also fired.\",\"sdkErrors\":[]},{\"name\":\"onFocus\",\"fqn\":\"FocusMixin.onFocus\",\"slug\":\"on-focus\",\"isDeprecated\":false,\"isInternal\":false,\"actionErrors\":[],\"isDeveloperPreview\":false,\"maturity\":\"GA\",\"requiredProperties\":[\"handler\"],\"adminMethod\":false,\"returnType\":{\"kind\":\"REFERENCE\",\"name\":\"Element\",\"referenceFqn\":\"Element.Element\",\"description\":\"The element on which the event is now registered.\"},\"examples\":[{\"title\":\"Get the ID of the element that has received focus\",\"content\":\"$w(\\\"#myElement\\\").onFocus( (event) =\u003e {\\n  let targetId = event.target.id; // \\\"myElement\\\"\\n});\"}],\"actionParams\":[{\"name\":\"handler\",\"slug\":\"handler\",\"isDeprecated\":false,\"isInternal\":false,\"maturity\":\"GA\",\"type\":{\"kind\":\"REFERENCE\",\"name\":\"EventHandler\",\"referenceFqn\":\"EventHandler\",\"isFunction\":true},\"description\":\"The name of the function or\\r\\n the function expression to run when the element receives focus.\"}],\"description\":\"Adds an event handler that runs when the element receives focus.\\r\\n\\r\\nAn element receives focus through user actions,\\r\\n such as clicking and tabbing, or programmatically, using the\\r\\n [focus( )](#focus) function.\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003e **Note:** `onFocus()` has no effect when applied to [RadioButtonGroup]($w.RadioButtonGroup.html) elements.\",\"sdkErrors\":[]},{\"name\":\"onMouseIn\",\"fqn\":\"Button.Button.onMouseIn\",\"slug\":\"on-mouse-in\",\"isDeprecated\":false,\"isInternal\":false,\"actionErrors\":[],\"isDeveloperPreview\":false,\"maturity\":\"GA\",\"requiredProperties\":[\"handler\"],\"adminMethod\":false,\"returnType\":{\"kind\":\"REF