ite visitor clicks on a tab menu item.\",\"sdkErrors\":[]},{\"name\":\"onTabItemClicked\",\"fqn\":\"Tabs.onTabItemClicked\",\"slug\":\"on-tab-item-clicked\",\"isDeprecated\":false,\"isInternal\":false,\"actionErrors\":[],\"isDeveloperPreview\":false,\"maturity\":\"GA\",\"requiredProperties\":[\"eventHandler\"],\"adminMethod\":false,\"returnType\":{\"kind\":\"REFERENCE\",\"name\":\"Tabs\",\"referenceFqn\":\"Tabs.Tabs\",\"description\":\"The tabs element on which the event is registered.\"},\"examples\":[{\"title\":\"Get the ID of the tab whose menu item was clicked\",\"content\":\"$w(\\\"#myTabsElement\\\").onTabItemClicked((event) =\u003e {\\n  let tabItemClicked = event.tabId; // \\\"singleTab2\\\"\\n});\"}],\"actionParams\":[{\"name\":\"eventHandler\",\"slug\":\"event-handler\",\"isDeprecated\":false,\"isInternal\":false,\"maturity\":\"GA\",\"type\":{\"kind\":\"REFERENCE\",\"name\":\"EventHandler\",\"referenceFqn\":\"EventHandler\",\"isFunction\":true},\"description\":\"The name of the function or\\r\\nthe function expression to run when a site visitor clicks a tab menu item.\"}],\"description\":\"Adds an event handler that runs when any tab menu item is clicked.\\r\\n\\r\\n`onTabItemClicked()` runs when a site visitor clicks on any tab menu item in the tabs element.\",\"sdkErrors\":[]},{\"name\":\"orderTabs\",\"fqn\":\"Tabs.orderTabs\",\"slug\":\"order-tabs\",\"isDeprecated\":false,\"isInternal\":false,\"actionErrors\":[],\"isDeveloperPreview\":false,\"maturity\":\"GA\",\"requiredProperties\":[\"orderedTabIds\"],\"adminMethod\":false,\"returnType\":{\"kind\":\"PROMISE\",\"argumentType\":{\"kind\":\"PRIMITIVE\",\"name\":\"void\"},\"description\":\"Fulfilled - when the tabs are reordered.\"},\"examples\":[{\"title\":\"Reorder tabs using tab IDs\",\"content\":\"$w(\\\"#myTabsElement\\\").orderTabs([\\\"singleTab3\\\", \\\"singleTab1\\\", \\\"singleTab2\\\"]);\\n\\nlet myUpdatedTabs = $w(\\\"#myTabsElement\\\").tabs;\\n/*\\n * [\\n *   $w(\\\"#singleTab3\\\"), \\n * 