 property,\\r\\n `descending()` sorts the results in descending order by each property in the\\r\\n order they are listed.\\r\\n\\r\\n You can sort the following types:\\r\\n\\r\\n + Number: Sorts numerically.\\r\\n + Date: Sorts by date and time.\\r\\n + String: Sorts lexicographically, so `\\\"abc\\\"` comes before `\\\"XYZ\\\"`.\\r\\n + Reference: Compares by the ID of the referenced item as a String.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n If a property contains a number as a String, that value will be sorted\\r\\n alphabetically and not numerically. Items that do not have a value for the\\r\\n specified sort property are ranked lowest.\",\"sdkErrors\":[]}],\"webhooks\":[],\"articles\":[{\"content\":\"# Introduction\\nProvides the ability to sort the items in a dataset, based on one or more fields, in either ascending or descending order.\\n\\nWhen working with [Wix app collections](https://support.wix.com/en/article/velo-working-with-wix-app-collections-and-code), check [which fields](https://support.wix.com/en/search?term=velo%20collection%20fields) can be used in a sort.\",\"displayName\":\"Introduction\",\"slugifyName\":\"introduction\"}],\"builderTypes\":[],\"properties\":[]},{\"name\":\"WixEvents\",\"slug\":\"wix-events\",\"fqn\":\"WixEvents\",\"standaloneTypes\":[],\"metadata\":{},\"actions\":[{\"name\":\"delete\",\"fqn\":\"Element.delete\",\"slug\":\"delete\",\"isDeprecated\":false,\"isInternal\":false,\"actionErrors\":[],\"isDeveloperPreview\":false,\"maturity\":\"GA\",\"adminMethod\":false,\"returnType\":{\"kind\":\"PROMISE\",\"argumentType\":{\"kind\":\"PRIMITIVE\",\"name\":\"void\"},\"description\":\"Fulfilled - When the element's `deleted` property has been set to `true`.\"},\"examples\":[{\"title\":\"Delete an element from the DOM\",\"content\":\"$w(\\\"#myElement\\\").delete();\"},{\"title\":\"Delete an element from the DOM and log a message when done\",\"content\":\"$w(\\\"#myElement\\\").delete()\\n  .then( () =\u003e {\\n    console.log(\\\"Done with delete\\\");\\n