t has entered the viewport\",\"content\":\"$w(\\\"#myElement\\\").onViewportEnter( (event) =\u003e {\\n  let targetId = event.target.id; // \\\"myElement\\\"\\n});\"}],\"actionParams\":[{\"name\":\"handler\",\"slug\":\"handler\",\"isDeprecated\":false,\"isInternal\":false,\"maturity\":\"GA\",\"type\":{\"kind\":\"REFERENCE\",\"name\":\"EventHandler\",\"referenceFqn\":\"EventHandler\",\"isFunction\":true},\"description\":\"The name of the function or\\r\\n the function expression to run when the element enters the viewport.\"}],\"description\":\"Adds an event handler that runs when an element is displayed\\r\\n in the viewable part of the current window.\\r\\n\\r\\nAn element enters the viewport when the page is scrolled to show any\\r\\n part of the element. An element also enters the viewport if it was\\r\\n `hidden` or `collapsed`\\r\\n and is then shown or expanded in the viewable part of the current window. `onViewportEnter()` \\r\\n is not fired for `hidden` or `collapsed` \\r\\n elements even if they are scrolled into view.\",\"sdkErrors\":[]},{\"name\":\"onViewportLeave\",\"fqn\":\"ViewportMixin.onViewportLeave\",\"slug\":\"on-viewport-leave\",\"isDeprecated\":false,\"isInternal\":false,\"actionErrors\":[],\"isDeveloperPreview\":false,\"maturity\":\"GA\",\"requiredProperties\":[\"handler\"],\"adminMethod\":false,\"returnType\":{\"kind\":\"REFERENCE\",\"name\":\"Element\",\"referenceFqn\":\"Element.Element\",\"description\":\"The element on which the event is now registered.\"},\"examples\":[{\"title\":\"Get the ID of the element that has left the viewport\",\"content\":\"$w(\\\"#myElement\\\").onViewportLeave( (event) =\u003e {\\n  let targetId = event.target.id; // \\\"myElement\\\"\\n});\"}],\"actionParams\":[{\"name\":\"handler\",\"slug\":\"handler\",\"isDeprecated\":false,\"isInternal\":false,\"maturity\":\"GA\",\"type\":{\"kind\":\"REFERENCE\",\"name\":\"EventHandler\",\"referenceFqn\":\"EventHandler\",\"isFunction\":true},\"description\":\"The name of th